Note on mutagen: it is licensed GPL-2.0-or-later. Importing it at runtime from
an MIT-licensed script is the usual arrangement for a tool distributed as
source, but if you redistribute this as a single bundled binary that embeds
mutagen, the combined work is generally treated as GPL. Distributing the
script by itself, with dependencies installed separately via pip, keeps them
independent works.

